Nuvora Core native application compatibility and scalar-memory verification
Baseline: d5ceaa6d690eecf9a3846494b570dbf5c35906d0 (local and GitHub main matched before changes).
x86-64: cached Arch nuvora-arch-check:20261002; GCC 16.2.1, QEMU 11.1.1, OVMF 202608.
ARM64: Arch nuvora-arch-arm-check:20261011; cross GCC 16.1.0, QEMU 11.1.2.
Extra scalar-memory ASan/UBSan, PIE UBSan and microbenchmark: host GCC 14.2.0.

Baseline rejection of a valid pure PIE:
pie-red: tests/native64_test.c:120: loader_pie: Assertion `prepare_image(&task,"/apps/pie","PIE arguments",&frame)==0' failed.

